  "card": "Reject SQLite wallets missing a FLAGS record with a graceful error instead of crashing the node. Missing FLAGS records previously caused the wallet loader to fall back to legacy handling and trigger unhandled assertions in SetupLegacyDataSPKM or LoadActiveScriptPubKeyMan, crashing the node on loadwallet or startup. The PR also adjusts bitcoin-wallet create so it no longer loads an empty database during creation.",
